WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.796
A bitcoin wallet that's easy to use. And no company holds a key.

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.305
Three keys, all yours: a hardware wallet, your phone, and your own home server.

3
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:14.720
Any two of them move your money.

4
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:20.252
Everyday payments use your phone and your guardian, up to a daily limit.

5
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:25.149
Big payments and rule changes need your hardware wallet.

6
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:31.281
It's plain multisig, so any wallet can recover it. Even without Trikey.

7
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:35.050
Trikey. Pre-alpha, and building in public.
